The lab
The lab is a small HPACK and QPACK codec in plain Python. It is checked against every worked example in RFC 7541 Appendix C and RFC 9204 Appendix B, then used for experiments. Nothing is installed and nothing needs root; lab-hpack.sh fetches rfc7541.txt and rfc9204.txt from rfc-editor.org once if they are not already next to the scripts, and every table comes from those files.

